# settings-dark-themes (SM · Six themes, the dark three): System on a dark system, each dark theme
# picked in the panel in turn: a pick applies at once and the panel stays (D2), so the shot at the
# click's own instant shows the page and the panel in the new theme, the row under the pointer;
# then the pointer rests in the gap between the settings and the panel shows as the board draws it.
# Positions at 1440 x 900 from the reference's DOM with the panel open (tools/run dom): the gear
# (1363, 28, 40 x 40), the panel (1099, 76, 304 x 256); the Appearance toggle's options 91.33 x 34
# from (1113, 112) (System, Light, Dark: centres 1159, 1251, 1343 at y 129); the theme rows 278 x 36
# from (1112, 211), 36 apart (centres at y 229, 265, 301); the help line (1112, 155, 278 x 18); the
# gap between the two settings y 173 to 189. The panel's opening runs 643 ms, so a shot of it at
# rest waits 700.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode system
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 1383 48
wait 700
move 1250 181
wait 16
shot arctic-ice
click 1251 265
shot tron-cyan-click
move 1250 181
wait 16
shot tron-cyan
click 1251 301
shot midnight-violet-click
move 1250 181
wait 16
shot midnight-violet
